  "data":{"canonical_id":"arXiv:2605.05467","arxiv_id":"2605.05467","doi":"10.48550/arXiv.2605.05467","openreview_id":null,"arxiv_categories":{"primary":"cs.DC","cross_list":[]},"title":"Nitsum: Serving Tiered LLM Requests with Adaptive Tensor Parallelism","summary":"Nitsumは、厳しい対話型SLOと緩いbackground要求が同一GPU poolで競合する環境で、tensor parallelism（TP）を静的deployment設定ではなく1秒単位で変更するruntime control surfaceとして扱う。各GPUに重みのfull copyを一つ保持し、TP levelごとのwarm processが必要shardだけを選ぶことでreload/compileを避ける。TP変更時の断片KVはdouble-bufferでaggregateしてinterconnect転送と重ね、0.5–5GBのmigrationを3.6–24.8msへ短縮する。global schedulerはSLO-compliant goodput/GPUを推定してTP level、prefill/decode GPU比、tier配分を共同最適化する。A100/H100、production traces、Llama8B/Qwen14B等で既存方式比goodput最大5.3倍を報告する。","list_summary":"TP levelを1秒単位のruntime制御にし、reload-free weight reuse＋3.6–24.8ms KV migration＋SLO-aware GPU配分でtiered servingのgoodputを最大5.3倍。","authors":["Vikranth Srivatsa","Zijian He","Pu Guo","Dongming Li","Yiying Zhang"],"authors_affiliations":"University of California, San Diego、GenseeAI Inc.。","published":"2026-05-06","publication":"arXiv:2605.05467v1","publication_type":"プレプリント","publication_status":"arXiv v1","lineage":"llm-serving-scheduling-disaggregation","topics":["tensor parallelism","tiered SLO","dynamic reconfiguration","KV migration","prefill/decode disaggregation","goodput scheduling"],"importance":"高。TPをstatic topologyからruntime resource-controlへ変え、weight/KV transition costとschedulerを一体設計する。","hardware_evaluation":"RunPod上の実GPU。8-GPU NVLink node、A100 80GB/H100 80GB。","hardware_details":"A100 node 128 vCPU/2TB RAM、H100 node 224 vCPU/2TB RAM。Llama-3.1 8B/70B、DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-14B、FP16。","quality_effect":"モデル重み値や生成計算の近似は変えず、parallelism/placement/schedulingを変えるため生成品質への近似誤差はない。","storage_targets":["GPU上のfull model weight copy","TP-specific logical shards","request KV cache","temporary contiguous KV buffers"],"bottlenecks":["TP変更時のweight reload/compile","PagedAttention由来KV fragmentation","tier間GPU固定分割","静的TPによるTTFT/TPOT tradeoff"],"evidence_locations":["§2.3","§3.1-3.3","§4.1-4.2"],"source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05467","sources":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05467","https://arxiv.org/html/2605.05467"],"code":null,"implementation":"SGLangを基盤にglobal/local scheduler、GPU kernels、KV migrationを改変し約12K source linesを追加/変更。global schedulerはmulti-threaded Rust。著者固有repository URLは一次資料から確認できない。","last_checked":"2026-09-13","references":[{"canonical_id":"arXiv:2309.06180","arxiv_id":"2309.06180"},{"canonical_id":"arXiv:2401.09670","arxiv_id":"2401.09670"}],"references_checked_at":"2026-09-13","references_source":"arXiv v1 HTML参考文献節の主要関連研究","references_total":null}
}

